# Shell scripts are read by dash on the VPS. A CRLF line ending makes it fail with
# "Syntax error: Bad fd number", which names neither the file nor the cause — it cost time on
# 2026-11-03. Pin the stored form and the checkout form so a Windows clone cannot produce one.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
